{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/2889","id":4796003743,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGhPPJ88AAAABHd01nw","html_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pull/2889","diff_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pull/2889.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pull/2889.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/issues/2889","number":2889,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[QA3 shadow] Add fixed source-only QA and preserve attempt evidence","user":{"login":"Ryosuke-Asano","id":73892113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkyMTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73892113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryosuke-Asano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Release and Alpha currently have no separate receipt for a fixed source-only QA plan. This adds one reusable, nonblocking shadow source job per package workflow, with 106 existing host cases (60 Deno, 28 Node, 18 Python), exact case/file matching, fail-closed completion checks, and preserved run-attempt evidence. Existing jobs, needs, signing, approval, packaging schema, and publisher gates remain unchanged.\n\nThe executor uses exclusive outputs, a 180-second group timeout, owned process-group cleanup, a 16-MiB regular-file write limit, and a credential-free child environment. Node 22's file-less JUnit records are bound only to the registered single Node input and exact case IDs. Source PASS leaves product/Runtime qualification UNVERIFIED and publicationAuthorized=false.\n\nCold CI exposed unwanted root workspace npm initialization. The fixed Deno command now uses a host-only import map and frozen JSR lock, no root config/npm/package.json autodetection, and no node_modules. Preflight requires exact equality with the root's four standard-library aliases and all JSR specifiers/integrity records; root deno.json/deno.lock and the 106-case policy are unchanged. Receipts record both root and host input digests. Two deterministic generated docs pages were refreshed with the existing generator.\n\nValidation:\n- Final cold [source job](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/actions/runs/37887329016/job/113680154604): 16 executor contracts PASS; all 106 real source cases PASS with each group exit 0; artifact upload succeeded. PR head 718e688fbd7ad88a776534e7778ad8e4a7f67364, actual PR-merge checkout f0349d329054ed11225dd101714b7ba5f5bc9a0c, attempt 1.\n- Final [Docs CI](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/actions/runs/37887329118/job/113680154554): inventory verification and unit tests PASS.\n- Clean local Node 22.23.3 / Deno 2.9.7: 106 PASS; 16 contract tests PASS. Ruff/format, Deno format, actionlint and diff checks PASS.\n- Independent read-only review: Go for this shadow scope; no unresolved blocking P0/P1/P2. Existing protected gate/browser files remain byte-identical to main.\n\nThe initial failed source jobs remain visible: [7f615f9b](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/actions/runs/37884386005/job/113670991399), [4d6d9ab0](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/actions/runs/37885771088/job/113675320704), and [30bcde2d](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/actions/runs/37886018412/job/113676091422). These were fixed with new commits, without automatic retries or erasing raw FAIL. Overall workflow success through continue-on-error is not source PASS; both raw contract exit and source verdict must be evaluated.\n\nThis is an independent minimal QA3-04/11 foundation. The Library kit could not be materialized through the supported flow (HTTP 403); ZIP/MANIFEST/code safety and its reported 114 tests remain unverified. Actions artifact metadata/upload and decoded job logs were verified, but ZIP receipt bytes could not be downloaded (HTTP 403). Full native/Debug/final signed product QA, test-support/harness, trusted cross-run first-FAIL history, issuer/revocation/expiry, Agent execution and publisher promotion remain deferred. No merge, release, signing, notarization, publication or manual heavy workflow dispatch was performed.\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:32:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T05:14:04Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"f0349d329054ed11225dd101714b7ba5f5bc9a0c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/2889/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/2889/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/issues/2889/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp/statuses/718e688fbd7ad88a776534e7778ad8e4a7f67364","head":{"label":"Floorp-Projects:codex/qa3-shadow-foundation","ref":"codex/qa3-shadow-foundation","sha":"718e688fbd7ad88a776534e7778ad8e4a7f67364","user":{"login":"Floorp-Projects","id":94953125,"node_id":"O_kgDOBajepQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94953125?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Projects","html_url":"https://github.com/F